! player~turnonansi

Turns ANSI back on through the shared player prompt path.

''Include:'' [[player.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/player.ts:880`

!! Loaded Variables
No `loadvar` statements were detected in this routine.

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
#-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
send &quot;c n&quot;
killalltriggers
waiton &quot;(1) ANSI graphics&quot;
getword currentline $player~ansistatus 5
if ($player~ansistatus = &quot;Off&quot;)
	send &quot;1 q q&quot;
else
